      "message": "test(ui): re-render the stale egui_tool_editor golden\n\nThe golden predates #244/#162; the current render differs only by a\n20-pixel sliver of the properties panel's scrollbar (the catalog/panel\ncontent height changed). Not a crash - the earlier ptr/mod.rs reading\nwas the snapshot assert's own panic. tool_editor_snapshot passes twice\nin a row against the new image on a tree whose ui/app/tools sources\nequal main f4e4eac.\n\nFixes #262\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
